<section class="prep-flow" aria-labelledby="prep-flow-title">
  <h2 id="prep-flow-title">Use the same discipline for every serious agenda item.</h2>
  <div class="prep-flow__steps">
    <article>
      <span>1</span>
      <h3>Name the decision</h3>
      <p>If there is no decision, ask why the item is taking board time.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>2</span>
      <h3>Find the authority</h3>
      <p>Check bylaws, policies, prior votes, committees, and delegated limits.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>3</span>
      <h3>Build the record</h3>
      <p>Make sure minutes show the action, documents, conflicts, and vote result.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

